      "showAdvanced": null,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "# FLUX.2 Klein KV · LITE · Generate\n\nChoose Standard or KV in Model: Standard / KV. Only the selected model is loaded. KV uses FluxKVCache for reference-image editing. Both use Qwen3 8B (flux2), Flux2 VAE and 128-channel latents.\n\nStart with 4 steps, CFG 1, Euler / simple and automatic Flux 2 shift. The Flux 2 Klein Distilled sampler profile applies to both models.\n\nEnter a prompt, set Resolution and run. For reference-image editing, use a FULL Img2Img workflow and select Edit (native)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# FLUX.2 Klein KV · LITE · Generate\n\nChoose Standard or KV in Model: Standard / KV. Only the selected model is loaded. KV uses FluxKVCache for reference-image editing. Both use Qwen3 8B (flux2), Flux2 VAE and 128-channel latents.\n\nStart with 4 steps, CFG 1, Euler / simple and automatic Flux 2 shift. The Flux 2 Klein Distilled sampler profile applies to both models.\n\nEnter a prompt, set Resolution and run. For reference-image editing, use a FULL Img2Img workflow and select Edit (native)."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
